Modification notice
-------------------

This distribution is a MODIFIED version of Baritone, not the original.

    Modified during 2025-2026 by dysnasia (https://github.com/dysnasia)
    Fork:  https://github.com/dysnasia/baritone-26.2

The modifications consist of a port to Minecraft 26.2 / Java 25 / Mojang mappings for the
Fabric, Forge and NeoForge loaders, together with changes to elytra pathing and some build
and packaging changes. They are described in README.md. Everything else -- the pathfinder,
the movement, mining, building and schematic systems, the command system and the settings --
is the work of the upstream authors and is unchanged in substance.

No claim of authorship is made over any part of the original work.


